dropping that one slot leaves an object that writes out as JSON. The \code{umap}
object is the one genuinely unportable thing this package produces: its
\code{config$metric.function} is a function. In a Python transcription this is the
separate \code{umap-learn} package rather than anything in scikit-learn.
